 r←StashApply(space folder Args);stashNo
⍝ Applies the given or last stash and remove it from the stash stack
⍝ Desc: (Re)-apply stash (by default the last one) to the working area & DO NOT remove from stash stack
⍝ Parse: 1s -n=
⍝ Project: 1
 stashNo←0 Args.Switch'n'
 r←↑stashNo ##.StashApply folder
⍝Done
